---
/**
 * Reusable A–D tier blurb aligned with evidence-graph SCHEMA.md.
 * Use on /about and anywhere a legend is needed.
 */
---

<section class="tier-legend" aria-labelledby="tier-legend-heading">
  <h2 id="tier-legend-heading" class="tier-legend__title">Evidence tiers A–D</h2>
  <p class="tier-legend__intro">
    Claims carry an evidence tier from the Shared Evidence Graph
    (<code>SCHEMA.md</code>). Higher letters are stronger; C and D always
    surface limitations in the UI.
  </p>
  <dl class="tier-legend__list">
    <div class="tier-legend__row">
      <dt>
        <span class="tier-badge tier-badge--a" aria-hidden="true"
          ><span class="tier-badge__text">Tier A</span></span
        >
        <span class="visually-hidden">Tier A</span>
      </dt>
      <dd>Strong clinical / consensus support</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="tier-legend__row">
      <dt>
        <span class="tier-badge tier-badge--b" aria-hidden="true"
          ><span class="tier-badge__text">Tier B</span></span
        >
        <span class="visually-hidden">Tier B</span>
      </dt>
      <dd>Solid clinical evidence or high-quality synthesis</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="tier-legend__row">
      <dt>
        <span class="tier-badge tier-badge--c" aria-hidden="true"
          ><span class="tier-badge__text">Tier C</span></span
        >
        <span class="visually-hidden">Tier C</span>
      </dt>
      <dd>Mechanistic, preclinical, case-level, or early signal</dd>
    </div>
    <div class="tier-legend__row">
      <dt>
        <span class="tier-badge tier-badge--d" aria-hidden="true"
          ><span class="tier-badge__text">Tier D</span></span
        >
        <span class="visually-hidden">Tier D</span>
      </dt>
      <dd>Contested, insufficient, or highly uncertain</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
  <p class="tier-legend__note">
    <strong>Limitations:</strong> tiers <strong>C</strong> and <strong>D</strong>
    require a non-empty <code>limitations</code> string in the graph; Desk shows
    those inline (never behind a click). Limitations are strongly recommended for
    tier <strong>B</strong>.
  </p>
</section>
